area: config
case: 93-float-nan
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: config
reason: the port refuses TOML's bare [nan] where the oracle hands the key a NaN. This tree's TOML lexer cannot read the word, and no bound in this config can be satisfied by a NaN, so the loader reports the wrong type naming the key rather than accepting a value nothing can compare against; TOML's bare [inf] is read, because infinity has a float spelling the lexer takes. D-E in plans/duplication-and-simplification-plan.md records the decision. The extractor-default difference every other config golden records is folded into the refusal.
--- oracle
default=-
permitted=-
providers_defaulted=true
enabled=exa:free,freeserp,parallel:free
effective=exa:free,freeserp,parallel:free
free_only=true
missing_keys=
missing_agent=
policy,500,2000,10.000000
fetch,true,trafilatura,nan,8388608,40000,200,6000,3,false,false,seekwright/0.1.1 (+https://github.com/leoschwarz/seekwright),-,false,http,-,-,-,60.000000,-,268435456,33554432,300.000000
search,-,-,60.000000,3,120.000000
agent,false,-,-,90.000000,30.000000,24000,500,2500,0.250000,-,-
logging,INFO,text,WARNING,false,false,false
dashboard,true,-
provider exa:free enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
provider freeserp enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
provider parallel:free enabled=true cost=- depth=standard output=sourcedAnswer mode=fast url=- cooldown=60.000000 app=- index=- title_attr=- url_attr=- snippet_attr=-
--- port
ERR fetch.timeout_seconds: expected a number, found 'nan'
